==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|sh|sla-pro|*jebati}}, from {{der|sh|ine-pro|*h₃yebʰ-}}. Cognate with {{cog|grc|οἴφω}}, {{cog|sa|यभति}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{sh-IPA|jèbati}}
* {{hyphenation|sh|је|ба|ти}}

===Verb===
{{sh-verb|head=јѐбати|a=impf}}

# {{lb|sh|transitive|vulgar}} to [[fuck]]
#: {{uxi|sh|јебао сам је ц(иј)ело љето/лето.|I was fucking her the whole summer.}}
#: {{uxi|sh|јебао сам је дивље у гузу све до зоре.|I kept fucking her in the ass wildly until dawn.}}
# {{lb|sh|reflexive|vulgar}} to have [[sexual]] [[relation]]s with someone
#: {{uxi|sh|јебемо се као зечеви кад год стигнемо.|We fuck like rabbits whenever we can.}}
#: {{uxi|sh|њих двоје се јебу.|The two of them are having [regular] sex.}}
# {{lb|sh|transitive|vulgar|figuratively}} to [[bother]], [[pest]], [[annoy]]
#: {{uxi|sh|немој ме јебати више!|Stop fucking with me!}}
#: {{uxi|sh|ц(иј)ело вр(иј)еме док сам возио јебао ме са својим срањима.|All the way while I was driving he was bothering me with his shit.}}
# {{lb|sh|transitive|vulgar|figuratively}} not to [[pay attention]], not to [[give a flying fuck]]
#: {{uxi|sh|ја јој причам а она ме не јебе.|I keep talking to her and she doesn't give a fuck.}}
#: {{uxi|sh|не јебе ме ни 2 посто!|[He/she] doesn't give a flying fuck about me.}}
# {{non-gloss|figurative and idiomatic senses}}
#: {{uxi|sh|јеби га!|Fuck it!}}
#: {{uxi|sh|нек се јебе.|He/she can go fuck himself/herself.}}
#: {{uxi|sh|(т)ко те јебе!|Who gives a shit about you!}}
#: {{uxi|sh|ни(т)ко те не јебе.|Nobody gives a shit about you.}}
#: {{uxi|sh|можеш га/се јебати.|There is nothing you can do.}}
#: {{uxi|sh|јебе ми се.|I don't give a crap.}}

